        Transmit<br />Data.
      </h1>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-gutter">
        Awaiting input stream. All communications are securely routed through
        structural relays.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <a
          href="mailto:vitorzr00@gmail.com"
          class="flex items-center gap-4 border-[4px] border-on-surface p-4 bg-primary-fixed/20 hover:bg-[#E5F570] transition-all duration-200 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] active:translate-x-[4px] active:translate-y-[4px] active:shadow-none cursor-pointer text-decoration-none group block"
        >
          <span
            class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl text-on-surface group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
            style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">mail</span
          >
          <div>
            <p
              class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-on-surface-variant group-hover:text-on-surface transition-colors"
            >
              Primary Channel
            </p>
            <p class="font-mono-data text-mono-data font-bold text-on-surface">
              vitorzr00@gmail.com
            </p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-gutter pt-gutter border-t-[4px] border-on-surface">
        <p
          class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase text-on-surface font-bold mb-4"
        >
          Network Nodes [Socials]
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/Go-Pai"
            target="_blank"
            class="flex items-center justify-center border-[4px] border-on-surface w-14 h-14 bg-surface hover:bg-[#E5F570] transition-colors shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] active:shadow-none active:translate-x-[4px] active:translate-y-[4px] text-decoration-none group"
